commit be01aa218d38b128c7fa0600886a12c2d902fb82

C03: a verified visible click must be narrated with a click verb (UI1373)

UI1275 measured H0555 «en la calculadora apretá el 5»: the click on «Cinco» completed and verified, and the final said «Apagué el 5» (a wrong verb from the model) after the correct pairs said «Apreté el 5», «Pulsé el 7».

llm._payload_fact_defect: a verified input.visible.click final that carries no click verb (apretar/pulsar/presionar/tocar/hacer clic/click/press/tap) is missing_click_verb; the retry hint asks to say that the button was pressed. No fixed reply.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


